  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large kazan-cauldron over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, paprika, and cayenne pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add chicken broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Add brown rice and stir to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 18-20 minutes or until the liquid is absorbed.",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork and stir in chopped parsley and lemon juice."
